33
00:00:51.759 --> 00:00:52.479
Exactamente.

34
00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:53.920
y jieke

35
00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:54.960
Es el punto de avance.

36
00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:57.039
Parece ahora,

37
00:00:57.600 --> 00:00:58.719
La guardia de Jieke contra mí.

38
00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:01.039
